A licensee of a retail establishment under this article shall not operate the business in connection with any other mercantile establishment, provided this shall not prohibit a licensee from operating in the same building complex with other businesses. No retailer under this article shall sell, offer for sale, display or keep in stock at his or her place of business where packaged distilled spirits are offered for sale any other commodity except the following, all of which may be sold by the retailer at his or her option:
